{"id":23052,"name":"爱如此刻永恒","rarity":5,"path":"Memory","desc":"记忆命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"蔚蓝的天空映照出灿烂的明天。\\n一步、两步…少女行过的路是如此漫长，所幸那些珍藏的故事未被轮转的岁月遗忘。\\n而今，在众人共同的谱写下，史诗已然成篇，迎来尾声。\\n\\n群星，百花，飞鸟，美好的新世界。\\n轻纱，花环，长裙，风儿衔来祝福。\\n三千万世的追寻化作幸福的一瞬，足以抵过永恒的千言万语。\\n\\n<i>「嘻，约好啦……」</i>\\n少女回眸，莞尔一笑。\\n<i>「一人留在过去，一人走向未来…但我们的心，从未分离♪」</i>\\n\\n她踮起脚尖，走入过往——\\n而记忆，化作往昔的涟漪，向着明日荡去。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23052,"name":"约定","desc":"使装备者的速度提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者的忆灵对我方单体施放忆灵技时获得【空白】：敌方全体受到的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者的忆灵对敌方施放忆灵技时获得【诗行】：我方全体的暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者的忆灵同时持有【空白】和【诗行】时，【空白】和【诗行】的效果提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.18,0.16,0.1,0.6]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.21,0.19,0.12,0.65]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,0.22,0.14,0.7]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.27,0.25,0.16,0.75]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.3,0.28,0.18,0.8]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":57.6,"hp_add":8.64,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":115001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":126.72,"hp_add":8.64,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110251,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":218.88,"hp_add":8.64,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110252,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":311.04,"hp_add":8.64,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110252,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":115002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":403.2,"hp_add":8.64,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":147,"defence_a